/*
 * Implements validation for `yield` instructions in Ymir.
 *
 * A `yield` hands a value to the consumer of the generator it appears in, and
 * suspends the generator body until it is resumed. A `yield in` hands every value
 * of another generator, until it is over.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::instruction::yield_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/instruction/yield_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-27
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
